{
  "kind": "bands",
  "schema": {
    "$defs": {
      "Ball": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "kind": {
            "const": "ball",
            "default": "ball",
            "title": "Kind",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "center_nm": {
            "default": [
              0.0,
              0.0,
              0.0
            ],
            "maxItems": 3,
            "minItems": 3,
            "prefixItems": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "number"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Center Nm",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "radius_nm": {
            "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
            "title": "Radius Nm",
            "type": "number"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "radius_nm"
        ],
        "title": "Ball",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "Box": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "kind": {
            "const": "box",
            "default": "box",
            "title": "Kind",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "center_nm": {
            "default": [
              0.0,
              0.0,
              0.0
            ],
            "maxItems": 3,
            "minItems": 3,
            "prefixItems": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "number"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Center Nm",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "size_nm": {
            "maxItems": 3,
            "minItems": 3,
            "prefixItems": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "number"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Size Nm",
            "type": "array"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "size_nm"
        ],
        "title": "Box",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "Circle": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "kind": {
            "const": "circle",
            "default": "circle",
            "title": "Kind",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "center_nm": {
            "default": [
              0.0,
              0.0
            ],
            "maxItems": 2,
            "minItems": 2,
            "prefixItems": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "number"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Center Nm",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "radius_nm": {
            "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
            "title": "Radius Nm",
            "type": "number"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "radius_nm"
        ],
        "title": "Circle",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "ConstantIndex": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "Wavelength-independent complex refractive index n + ik.",
        "properties": {
          "kind": {
            "const": "constant_index",
            "default": "constant_index",
            "title": "Kind",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "n_real": {
            "description": "Real part of the refractive index.",
            "title": "N Real",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "n_imag": {
            "default": 0.0,
            "description": "Extinction coefficient k (>= 0 for loss).",
            "minimum": 0,
            "title": "N Imag",
            "type": "number"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "n_real"
        ],
        "title": "ConstantIndex",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "ConstantPermittivity": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "Wavelength-independent complex relative permittivity.",
        "properties": {
          "kind": {
            "const": "constant_permittivity",
            "default": "constant_permittivity",
            "title": "Kind",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "eps_real": {
            "title": "Eps Real",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "eps_imag": {
            "default": 0.0,
            "minimum": 0,
            "title": "Eps Imag",
            "type": "number"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "eps_real"
        ],
        "title": "ConstantPermittivity",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "Drude": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "eps(w) = eps_inf - wp^2 / (w^2 + i*gamma*w), energies in eV.",
        "properties": {
          "kind": {
            "const": "drude",
            "default": "drude",
            "title": "Kind",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "eps_inf": {
            "default": 1.0,
            "title": "Eps Inf",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "wp_ev": {
            "description": "Plasma frequency in eV.",
            "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
            "title": "Wp Ev",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "gamma_ev": {
            "description": "Damping rate in eV.",
            "minimum": 0,
            "title": "Gamma Ev",
            "type": "number"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "wp_ev",
          "gamma_ev"
        ],
        "title": "Drude",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "DrudeLorentz": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "eps(w) = eps_inf - wp^2/(w^2 + i g w) + sum_j d_j w0_j^2 / (w0_j^2 - w^2 - i G_j w).\n\nThe form FDTD needs for auxiliary-differential-equation dispersion.\nFit one to measured data with :func:`lightsmith.materials_fit.fit_drude_lorentz`.",
        "properties": {
          "kind": {
            "const": "drude_lorentz",
            "default": "drude_lorentz",
            "title": "Kind",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "eps_inf": {
            "default": 1.0,
            "title": "Eps Inf",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "wp_ev": {
            "default": 0.0,
            "minimum": 0,
            "title": "Wp Ev",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "gamma_ev": {
            "default": 0.0,
            "minimum": 0,
            "title": "Gamma Ev",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "poles": {
            "items": {
              "$ref": "#/$defs/LorentzPole"
            },
            "title": "Poles",
            "type": "array"
          }
        },
        "title": "DrudeLorentz",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "Ellipse": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "kind": {
            "const": "ellipse",
            "default": "ellipse",
            "title": "Kind",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "center_nm": {
            "default": [
              0.0,
              0.0
            ],
            "maxItems": 2,
            "minItems": 2,
            "prefixItems": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "number"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Center Nm",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "semi_axes_nm": {
            "maxItems": 2,
            "minItems": 2,
            "prefixItems": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "number"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Semi Axes Nm",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "angle_deg": {
            "default": 0.0,
            "title": "Angle Deg",
            "type": "number"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "semi_axes_nm"
        ],
        "title": "Ellipse",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "KPoint": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "label": {
            "title": "Label",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "reduced": {
            "description": "Coordinates in units of the reciprocal lattice vectors.",
            "maxItems": 3,
            "minItems": 3,
            "prefixItems": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "number"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Reduced",
            "type": "array"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "label",
          "reduced"
        ],
        "title": "KPoint",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "LibraryMaterial": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "Measured n, k bundled with lightsmith, e.g. ``{\"kind\": \"library\", \"name\": \"Au\",\n\"dataset\": \"Johnson-Christy\"}``. Linear interpolation in n and k, no extrapolation.\n\nNames and datasets accept aliases (\"gold\", \"JC\") and are stored in canonical form;\nan omitted dataset is filled with the material's default so the spec stays\nreproducible. See :func:`list_materials`.",
        "properties": {
          "kind": {
            "const": "library",
            "default": "library",
            "title": "Kind",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "name": {
            "description": "Material, e.g. 'Au', 'Ag', 'Al', 'Cu', 'Si', 'TiO2', 'SiO2', 'H2O'.",
            "title": "Name",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "dataset": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "default": null,
            "description": "Dataset, e.g. 'Johnson-Christy'; omitted = material default.",
            "title": "Dataset"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "name"
        ],
        "title": "LibraryMaterial",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "LorentzPole": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "delta_eps": {
            "description": "Oscillator strength (permittivity step).",
            "title": "Delta Eps",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "omega0_ev": {
            "description": "Resonance energy in eV.",
            "exclusiveMinimum": 0,
            "title": "Omega0 Ev",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "gamma_ev": {
            "description": "Damping in eV.",
            "minimum": 0,
            "title": "Gamma Ev",
            "type": "number"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "delta_eps",
          "omega0_ev",
          "gamma_ev"
        ],
        "title": "LorentzPole",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "Polygon": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "kind": {
            "const": "polygon",
            "default": "polygon",
            "title": "Kind",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "vertices_nm": {
            "items": {
              "maxItems": 2,
              "minItems": 2,
              "prefixItems": [
                {
                  "type": "number"
                },
                {
                  "type": "number"
                }
              ],
              "type": "array"
            },
            "minItems": 3,
            "title": "Vertices Nm",
            "type": "array"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "vertices_nm"
        ],
        "title": "Polygon",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "Prism": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "A 2D profile in the xy plane extruded from z_min to z_max (with optional sidewall angle).",
        "properties": {
          "kind": {
            "const": "prism",
            "default": "prism",
            "title": "Kind",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "profile": {
            "discriminator": {
              "mapping": {
                "circle": "#/$defs/Circle",
                "ellipse": "#/$defs/Ellipse",
                "polygon": "#/$defs/Polygon",
                "rectangle": "#/$defs/Rectangle"
              },
              "propertyName": "kind"
            },
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/Rectangle"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/Circle"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/Ellipse"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/Polygon"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Profile"
          },
          "z_min_nm": {
            "title": "Z Min Nm",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "z_max_nm": {
            "title": "Z Max Nm",
            "type": "number"
          },
          "sidewall_angle_deg": {
            "default": 0.0,
            "description": "0 = vertical; positive = narrower at the top.",
            "title": "Sidewall Angle Deg",
            "type": "number"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "profile",
          "z_min_nm",
          "z_max_nm"
        ],
        "title": "Prism",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "Rectangle": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "kind": {
            "const": "rectangle",
            "default": "rectangle",
            "title": "Kind",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "center_nm": {
            "default": [
              0.0,
              0.0
            ],
            "maxItems": 2,
            "minItems": 2,
            "prefixItems": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "number"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Center Nm",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "size_nm": {
            "maxItems": 2,
            "minItems": 2,
            "prefixItems": [
              {
                "type": "number"
              },
              {
                "type": "number"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Size Nm",
            "type": "array"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "size_nm"
        ],
        "title": "Rectangle",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "Structure": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "A material region. Later structures override earlier ones where they overlap.",
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "default": null,
            "title": "Name"
          },
          "geometry": {
            "discriminator": {
              "mapping": {
                "ball": "#/$defs/Ball",
                "box": "#/$defs/Box",
                "prism": "#/$defs/Prism"
              },
              "propertyName": "kind"
            },
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/Prism"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/Box"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/Ball"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Geometry"
          },
          "material": {
            "discriminator": {
              "mapping": {
                "constant_index": "#/$defs/ConstantIndex",
                "constant_permittivity": "#/$defs/ConstantPermittivity",
                "drude": "#/$defs/Drude",
                "drude_lorentz": "#/$defs/DrudeLorentz",
                "library": "#/$defs/LibraryMaterial",
                "tabulated": "#/$defs/Tabulated"
              },
              "propertyName": "kind"
            },
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/ConstantIndex"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/ConstantPermittivity"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/Drude"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/DrudeLorentz"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/Tabulated"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/LibraryMaterial"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Material"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "geometry",
          "material"
        ],
        "title": "Structure",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "Structure2D": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "properties": {
          "name": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "default": null,
            "title": "Name"
          },
          "profile": {
            "discriminator": {
              "mapping": {
                "circle": "#/$defs/Circle",
                "ellipse": "#/$defs/Ellipse",
                "polygon": "#/$defs/Polygon",
                "rectangle": "#/$defs/Rectangle"
              },
              "propertyName": "kind"
            },
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/Rectangle"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/Circle"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/Ellipse"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/Polygon"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Profile"
          },
          "material": {
            "discriminator": {
              "mapping": {
                "constant_index": "#/$defs/ConstantIndex",
                "constant_permittivity": "#/$defs/ConstantPermittivity",
                "drude": "#/$defs/Drude",
                "drude_lorentz": "#/$defs/DrudeLorentz",
                "library": "#/$defs/LibraryMaterial",
                "tabulated": "#/$defs/Tabulated"
              },
              "propertyName": "kind"
            },
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/ConstantIndex"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/ConstantPermittivity"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/Drude"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/DrudeLorentz"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/Tabulated"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "#/$defs/LibraryMaterial"
              }
            ],
            "title": "Material"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "profile",
          "material"
        ],
        "title": "Structure2D",
        "type": "object"
      },
      "Tabulated": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "Tabulated n, k data, linearly interpolated (no extrapolation).",
        "properties": {
          "kind": {
            "const": "tabulated",
            "default": "tabulated",
            "title": "Kind",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "wavelength_nm": {
            "items": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "title": "Wavelength Nm",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "n_real": {
            "items": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "title": "N Real",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "n_imag": {
            "items": {
              "type": "number"
            },
            "title": "N Imag",
            "type": "array"
          },
          "source": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ],
            "default": null,
            "description": "Citation / provenance of the data.",
            "title": "Source"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "wavelength_nm",
          "n_real",
          "n_imag"
        ],
        "title": "Tabulated",
        "type": "object"
      }
    },
    "additionalProperties": false,
    "description": "Band structure of a photonic crystal along a k-path.",
    "properties": {
      "kind": {
        "const": "bands",
        "default": "bands",
        "title": "Kind",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "dimension": {
        "default": 2,
        "enum": [
          2,
          3
        ],
        "title": "Dimension",
        "type": "integer"
      },
      "lattice_vectors_nm": {
        "items": {
          "maxItems": 3,
          "minItems": 3,
          "prefixItems": [
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "number"
            },
            {
              "type": "number"
            }
          ],
          "type": "array"
        },
        "maxItems": 3,
        "minItems": 2,
        "title": "Lattice Vectors Nm",
        "type": "array"
      },
      "background": {
        "discriminator": {
          "mapping": {
            "constant_index": "#/$defs/ConstantIndex",
            "constant_permittivity": "#/$defs/ConstantPermittivity",
            "drude": "#/$defs/Drude",
            "drude_lorentz": "#/$defs/DrudeLorentz",
            "library": "#/$defs/LibraryMaterial",
            "tabulated": "#/$defs/Tabulated"
          },
          "propertyName": "kind"
        },
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/ConstantIndex"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/ConstantPermittivity"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/Drude"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/DrudeLorentz"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/Tabulated"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/$defs/LibraryMaterial"
          }
        ],
        "title": "Background"
      },
      "structures_2d": {
        "description": "Unit-cell inclusions for 2D crystals.",
        "items": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/Structure2D"
        },
        "title": "Structures 2D",
        "type": "array"
      },
      "structures": {
        "description": "Unit-cell inclusions for 3D crystals.",
        "items": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/Structure"
        },
        "title": "Structures",
        "type": "array"
      },
      "k_path": {
        "items": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/KPoint"
        },
        "minItems": 2,
        "title": "K Path",
        "type": "array"
      },
      "points_per_segment": {
        "default": 16,
        "minimum": 1,
        "title": "Points Per Segment",
        "type": "integer"
      },
      "num_bands": {
        "default": 8,
        "minimum": 1,
        "title": "Num Bands",
        "type": "integer"
      },
      "polarization": {
        "default": "both",
        "description": "2D only: TE = E in plane, TM = E along z.",
        "enum": [
          "te",
          "tm",
          "both"
        ],
        "title": "Polarization",
        "type": "string"
      },
      "options": {
        "additionalProperties": {
          "additionalProperties": true,
          "type": "object"
        },
        "title": "Options",
        "type": "object"
      }
    },
    "required": [
      "lattice_vectors_nm",
      "background",
      "k_path"
    ],
    "title": "BandProblem",
    "type": "object"
  },
  "conventions": "Lightsmith conventions (fixed; changing them needs a schema version bump):\n- Lengths in nm. Wavelengths are vacuum wavelengths in nm.\n- Time dependence exp(-i omega t): absorbing materials have Im(eps) > 0 and Im(n) > 0.\n- Cross sections in nm^2; efficiencies Q = C / (pi r_eq^2), r_eq = volume-equivalent radius of all particles.\n- layer_stack / periodic: layers listed from the superstrate (incidence side) to the substrate; light travels +z.\n  R is measured in the superstrate, T in the substrate.\n- mode: cross-section in the xy plane, propagation along +z.\n- device: ports are planes whose normal is the axis where size_nm is zero; direction is into the device.\n- problem.options[<method or backend name>] holds solver options, validated by that backend.\n- Materials: {\"kind\": \"constant_index\", \"n_real\": .., \"n_imag\": ..}, {\"kind\": \"library\", \"name\": \"Au\"},\n  drude, drude_lorentz, tabulated, constant_permittivity. FDTD needs dispersive models (fit_drude_lorentz).\n- Results carry provenance and warnings: read the warnings before trusting the numbers.\n",
  "backends": [
    {
      "name": "lightsmith-pwe",
      "method": "pwe",
      "available": true,
      "gpu": true,
      "auto_rank": 0
    }
  ],
  "example": {
    "kind": "bands",
    "lattice_vectors_nm": [
      [
        500,
        0,
        0
      ],
      [
        0,
        500,
        0
      ]
    ],
    "background": {
      "kind": "constant_index",
      "n_real": 1.0
    },
    "structures_2d": [
      {
        "profile": {
          "kind": "circle",
          "radius_nm": 100
        },
        "material": {
          "kind": "constant_permittivity",
          "eps_real": 8.9
        }
      }
    ],
    "k_path": [
      {
        "label": "G",
        "reduced": [
          0,
          0,
          0
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "X",
        "reduced": [
          0.5,
          0,
          0
        ]
      },
      {
        "label": "M",
        "reduced": [
          0.5,
          0.5,
          0
